1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,862
A camera crew follows a man through a Detroit apartment building at night

2
00:00:04,725 --> 00:00:08,550
He washes his hands at the kitchen sink with methodical care -- too much care

3
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:10,700
like someone practicing ordinariness

4
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:14,225
A security camera timestamp reads nineteen-oh-one

5
00:00:14,463 --> 00:00:16,075
though the footage was shot tonight

6
00:00:16,938 --> 00:00:18,250
The crew keeps rolling

